# The work clone's BattleView.tsx has uncommitted other-lane work in
# flight as of 2026-10-25; applying this over that dirty tree risks a
# clobber. Verify with `git apply --check` on a clean checkout first,
# then run the game build. Context lines below are taken verbatim from
# the files as read 2026-10-25; if context has shifted, rebase the hunks
# by hand — do NOT force-apply with fuzz and hope.
#
# Files touched:
#   src/lib/battleTreatments.ts          (NEW — full text in battleTreatments.ts.txt, same folder)
#   src/components/game/PixiBattleCanvas.tsx
#   src/components/views/BattleView.tsx
#
# Behaviour change summary (see WIRING.md §3–§4 for the full flow):
#   - BattleAttack gains damageFraction + isCrit; executeDamage returns them.
#   - Pixi driver becomes treatments-driven: windup 250 (cameraZoom on the
#     ATTACKER) → travel 450 (existing lunge/projectile) → contact:
#     flash + directional particles + sampled shake, 90 ms frozen hold →
#     onImpact() at hold end (HP drains AFTER the freeze, not at contact)
#     → recoil 300 (sampled offset/rotation) → recover 400 (ease back,
#     camera release) → onDone(). Totals 1,490 ms physical/special.
#   - Old helpers flash()/shake() with Math.random() shake, fixed 14 px
#     recoil snap, and 220 ms flash fade are DELETED (replaced by sampling).
#   - Status branch is UNCHANGED (glow, impact 500 ms, done 900 ms).

